  "description": "Tamp meta-package — one PackageReference, one base-class inheritance, get the whole Wave 1+2 security chain: CycloneDX SBOM → SAST (OpenGrep + Roslyn) → SCA (osv-scanner + Dependency-Track) → Trivy secrets+misconfig → DefectDojo reimport. Adopters override `SecurityProductName` + `SecuritySolutionPath` and run `tamp Security`. DT and DD legs are env-var-gated; producer half runs unconditionally. .NET-focused for v0 — non-.NET adopters override Sbom to use Tamp.Syft instead.",
